  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main objective of this project is to provide lifesaving food and nutrition assistance to affected people. This WFP project provides cash-based food assistance and nutrition interventions for food insecure and moderately malnourished people. The project provides humanitarian assistance to 53,667 people, including 16,063 women, 23,674 children and 4,162 persons with disabilities.</narrative>
